    <string name="appearance_floating_bar_desc">The tab bar becomes a pill floating above the content, with a sliding indicator behind the selected item.</string>
    <string name="appearance_translucent_desc">The glass no longer covers the base color, keeping only blur and outline; text gets a halo in the opposite color so it stays legible.</string>
    <string name="appearance_monet_blur_desc">Tints the background and blur layer with the system\'s dynamic primary / secondary / tertiary colors. Requires dynamic color and Android 12+; otherwise this switch has no effect.</string>
    <string name="appearance_predictive_android15">Provided by the system since Android 15 (the system pushes the whole window during a back gesture), so this option no longer applies and is disabled.</string>
    <string name="appearance_predictive_on">During a back gesture the current page fades with your finger, so you can tell it will exit before releasing.</string>
    <string name="appearance_predictive_unsupported">Requires Android 13 / 14; this device has no predictive back gesture, so this option has no effect.</string>
    <string name="appearance_serial_desc">About twice a day the system picks a suitable moment to check, and only notifies when something changed; the same batch is reported once. It only uses the subscription list and your local reading times, and never uploads what you read. Off by default.</string>
    <string name="appearance_dynamic_color_desc">Take colors from the system wallpaper (Android 12+). The Material style follows the system entirely; the other glass styles only take the accent, keeping their own layered colors.</string>
